# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# vår: possessive pronoun "our" (Wiktionary "vår", Swedish, Norwegian Bokmål,
# Norwegian Nynorsk). The season takes a preposition or the definite suffix:
# "i vår", "våren".
vår
